	.string "so proud of you, and what you've\l"
	.string "achieved. Please, take care of yourself\l"
	.string "and be extremely cautious. Ulrich might\l"
	.string "come to find you. I don't want him to\l"
	.string "hurt you.' - Grandma Aisha$"
